; Reverse a Given List (and partial reverse)
;
; Task: implement reverse-list using recursion and construction/deconstruction primitives.
; Provide a follow-up reverse-Until that reverses first N elements.
;
; Approach
;
; Base case: empty list → ().
;
; Recursive decomposition: push the head to the end of reversed tail until base case.
;
; Function definition:
;
(= (reverse-list $list) 

)
;
!(reverse-list (A B C D)) 
; ;; Return -> (D C B A)
;
